BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:field-hockey-1@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260907T100000
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Field Hockey vs Marblehead (L 2–6)
LOCATION:Dr. Deering Stadium\, Danvers
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 2\, Marblehead 6\nSenio
 r captain Kyla Moroney and freshman Zoie Abell each had a goal and an assi
 st in the Labor Day opener\, but Marblehead pulled away on the Falcons' ho
 me turf.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/field-
 hockey/schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/field-hockey/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:field-hockey-2@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260908T160000
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Field Hockey vs Hamilton-Wenham (W 4–3)
LOCATION:Dr. Deering Stadium\, Danvers
DESCRIPTION:Non-league\nFinal: Danvers 4\, Hamilton-Wenham 3\nThe Falcons c
 ame from behind three separate times for their first win. Kyla Moroney had
  a hat trick and set up Zoie Abell's goal\, and freshman goalkeeper Ellie 
 Barnes made 14 saves.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfalconsathleti
 cs.org/field-hockey/schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/field-hockey/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:field-hockey-3@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260915T160000
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Field Hockey vs Peabody (W 8–3)
LOCATION:Dr. Deering Stadium\, Danvers
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 8\, Peabody 3\nFreshman
  Zoie Abell scored four goals\, and Kyla Moroney (a goal and three assists
 ) and Addie Moore (four assists) also finished with four points as Danvers
  built a 5–0 halftime lead at Deering Stadium.\nSchedule and results: ht
 tps://danversfalconsathletics.org/field-hockey/schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/field-hockey/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:field-hockey-4@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260917T190000
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Field Hockey vs Saugus (W 2–1)
LOCATION:Dr. Deering Stadium\, Danvers
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 2\, Saugus 1\nUnder the
  lights at Deering Stadium\, Kyla Moroney tied it 50 seconds before halfti
 me and won it on a penalty stroke in the third quarter. Danvers earned 15 
 corners and put 27 shots on goal in its third straight win.\nSchedule and 
 results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/field-hockey/schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/field-hockey/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
