DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261013T160000
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Field Hockey vs Malden Catholic (W 5–1)
LOCATION:Dr. Deering Stadium\, Danvers
DESCRIPTION:Non-league\nFinal: Danvers 5\, Malden Catholic 1\nDown 1–0 af
 ter a quarter and tied 1–1 going into the fourth\, the Falcons scored fo
 ur times in the final quarter. Captain Kyla Moroney had her second hat tri
 ck of the season and an assist\, and freshman Zoie Abell added two goals a
 nd two assists.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org
 /field-hockey/schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/field-hockey/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
