DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Field Hockey at Swampscott (T 3–3)
LOCATION:Blocksidge Field\, Swampscott
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 3\, Swampscott 3\nA bac
 k-and-forth game under the lights at Blocksidge Field ended level. Freshma
 n Zoie Abell scored twice and Kyla Moroney had a goal and an assist.\nSche
 dule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/field-hockey/schedul
 e.html
