DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261016T160000
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Field Hockey at Marblehead (W 5–3)
LOCATION:Piper Field\, Marblehead
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 5\, Marblehead 3\nDown 
 2–0 after the first quarter\, the Falcons came back behind their captain
 s: Kyla Moroney (a goal and two assists)\, Olivia Henry (a goal and an ass
 ist) and Addie Moore (a goal). Senior Mia Calabro and freshman Zoie Abell 
 each added a goal and an assist.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfal
 consathletics.org/field-hockey/schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/field-hockey/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:field-hockey-15@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261020T190000
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Field Hockey at Saugus (W 6–2)
LOCATION:Serino Field\, Saugus
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 6\, Saugus 2\nThe Falco
 ns scored six times under the lights at Serino Field to sweep the season s
 eries with Saugus\, getting back above .500 overall and to .500 in the con
 ference.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/field-
 hockey/schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/field-hockey/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
