DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Field Hockey at St. Mary's (L 0–5)
LOCATION:Manning Bowl\, Lynn
DESCRIPTION:Non-league\nFinal: Danvers 0\, St. Mary's 5\nA day after the wi
 n at Saugus\, the Falcons were shut out by St. Mary's on the turf at the M
 anning Bowl in a non-league game.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfa
 lconsathletics.org/field-hockey/schedule.html
