DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Field Hockey vs Bishop Fenwick (L 1–2)
LOCATION:Dr. Deering Stadium\, Danvers
DESCRIPTION:Non-league\nFinal: Danvers 1\, Bishop Fenwick 2\nThe Falcons le
 d 1–0 at halftime at Deering Stadium\, but Fenwick tied it late in the t
 hird quarter and Reese Robillard scored the winner with 17 seconds left. A
  month earlier Danvers had tied the Crusaders with a goal at the final whi
 stle.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/field-hoc
 key/schedule.html
